 "name": "botswana_map",
 "description": "Map of Botswana in the world_map style (054): flat green #6cbf5a land with dark #1d3b16 border, neighbours muted grey-green #b9c2a8, black frame, no labels, no fences. Okavango Delta light-blue fan in the NW with the panhandle river, Linyanti/Chobe and Limpopo border rivers, Makgadikgadi salt pans (Ntwetwe, Sua) as pale cream patches, Mababe Depression a faint tan patch at (24.4E,18.75S). Projection lon 19.5..29.5 E, lat 17.5..27.0 S, 80 px/deg: x = (lon - 24.5) * 80, y = -(lat + 22.25) * 80 (lat negative). Anchor centre, footprint x -400..400, y -380..380. Wobble 0 so fences line up.",
